CHAPTER.VERS:
And he gathered together the priests and the Levites, and said to them, Go out to the cities of Judah, and gather of all Israel money to repair the house of your

          {+}
         God from year to year; and see that you

          {+}
         hurry the matter. Nevertheless the Levites did not hurry it.

And the Spirit of God came upon Zechariah the son of Jehoiada the priest; and he stood above the people, and said to them, Thus says God, Why do you

          {+}
         transgress the commandments of Yahweh, so that you

          {+}
         can't prosper? Because you

          {+}
         have forsaken Yahweh, he has also forsaken you

          {+}
        .
